  },
  {
   "id": "d4-b28-t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 796.0,
   "y": 431.875,
   "width": 268.0,
   "height": 56.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1926594446,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 664322991,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "统一节点类型\n前向 / 反向 / 重算三类节点同构，\n共用同一套形状·类型·布局·资源计算机制",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d4-b28",
   "originalText": "统一节点类型\n前向 / 反向 / 重算三类节点同构，\n共用同一套形状·类型·布局·资源计算机制",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d4-t29",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 610.0,
   "y": 538.0,
   "width": 340.0,
   "height": 16.900000000000002,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 805622716,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1777966917,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "重算节点 = 前向 op2 的副本：同 SemanticId、新 NodeId、origin 回指。插在该区域反向节点之前。",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "start",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "重算节点 = 前向 op2 的副本：同 SemanticId、新 NodeId、origin 回指。插在该区域反向节点之前。",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "d4-t30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60.0,
   "y": 640.0,
   "width": 340.0,
   "height": 18.2,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1647183514,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 146271179,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "反向必须是派生层而不能写进 G0：G0 的定义就是 policy-free（∀f: policy(·) ∉ f.roots），而重算范围是策略。这条不变量是 CoreIR 唯一的断言点 —— 写进去就没地方陈述它了（G-L1）。",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "start",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "反向必须是派生层而不能写进 G0：G0 的定义就是 policy-free（∀f: policy(·) ∉ f.roots），而重算范围是策略。这条不变量是 CoreIR 唯一的断言点 —— 写进去就没地方陈述它了（G-L1）。",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "d4-t31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60.0,
   "y": 686.0,
   "width": 340.0,
   "height": 18.2,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 707358632,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 395963073,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "一组本来要写成「契约字段」的东西因此变成图里的普通节点与边：autograd 契约就是边，梯度值规格就是 TensorValue + StorageRelation，fan-in 累加就是一个 add 节点。",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "start",
